usage: compile_metta_package.py [-h] --out-dir OUT_DIR package_dir

Compile a MeTTa skill package into TRM bundle artifacts.

positional arguments:
  package_dir        Package directory containing package.manifest.json and
                     .metta files.

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --out-dir OUT_DIR  Output directory for the compiled bundle.
